2 CONT 4b. Sarah. (William (p. 1), John, Isaac) Born about 1674, at Salem, MA. Married William Bassett (born 1667, at Bridgewater, CT; died about December 12, 1741), at Filton, CT, on June? 14, 1693. Sarah died on April 13, 1703, age 29,
2 CONC  at Bridgewater, CT. Had four sons. Sarah's share of her brother Benjamin's estate was divided be?tween her four sons. Children of Sarah and William Bassett. 5a. William Bassett, Jr. Born in .1694. (p. 2) 5b. Joseph Bassett. Born 
2 CONC in 1696. (p. 2) 5c. Ruth Bassett. Born in 1700. (p. 2) 5d. Nathan Bassett. Born in .1702. (p. 2)
