2 CONT
2 CONT 2. http://services.dar.org/public/dar_research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A111957  DAR Ancestor # A111957] A Patriot of the American Revolution for CONNECTICUT  with the rank of PRIVATE.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-395276771-1-504388/luke-william-sweetland-the-captive-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-0c826164fff6a8d33ed5f44869b09120&mrid=836a9c03ace639e9711fd58cd3ff7271 MyHer
2 CONC itage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 18 2023, 14:16:06 UTC''
