2 CONC eld's Regiment of militia at West Point. Note: Israel SWETLAND was born on 12 Jan 1736 in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut. Genealogy of the Stebbins Family. Including Kindred Lines of Swetland, Wilcox and Cheney Families. By Will
2 CONC is Merrill Stebbins, Gothernburg, Nebraska. Press of Brown Printing Service, Lincoln, Nebraska, 1940. p. 90. Revolutionary soldier and served in Colonel Canfield's regiment of militia at West Point in Sept. 1781. He was married to
2 CONC  Dorcas DEWEY on 17 Jun1738 in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut. Genealogy of the Stebbins Family. Including Kindred Lines of Swetland, Wilcox and Cheney Families. By Willis Merrill Stebbins, Gothernburg, Nebraska. Press of Brown 
