1 NOTE Shubael, born June 17, 1793, in Longmeadow, Mass.; died in Norwalk, Ohio, January 26, 1889.  After his marriage he removed to Conneaut, Ohio, wher ehe bought a small farm.  He spent the last of his life in Norwalk with his son Aar
2 CONC on.  In 1850 he was living in Conneaut with his wife, his son, Chester, at home.  In the same house were his daughter-in-law, Maria,with her two children.
2 CONT Married December 25, 1816, SARAH SANFORD  of Litchfield, Conn., born about 1798.  From the book Abbe Abbey Genealogy Page 233.
