1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Theophilus Swetland==
2 CONT * BIRTH 17 January 1757
2 CONT * DEATH 17 May 1822
2 CONT
2 CONT When Theophilus Swetland was born on 17 January 1757, in Coventry, Windham, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Israel Swetland, was 21 and his mother, Dorcas Dewey, was 18. He married Zilpha Sprague on 8 May
2 CONC  1779. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters. He died on 17 May 1822, in East Longmeadow, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 65, and was buried in Billings Hill Cemetery, East Longmeadow, Hampd
2 CONC en, Massachusetts, United States.[1]  ...Theophilus father israel gave him a portion of his estate, the consideration was his good will and affection for him.  Theophilus, my grandfather, lived in Longmeadow, Mass. He was a farmer
2 CONC . Many a time I visited the old homestead but it has changed greatly since my boyhood. Theophilus was married twice, had nine  children by each wife. He lived to be 65 years old."[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents''' 
2 CONT Israel Swetland b: 12 JAN 1736 in Lebanon, CT
2 CONT Dorcas Dewey b: 17 JUN 1738 in Lebanon, CT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
2 CONT Zilpha Sprague Swetland c1758- in Of Coventry, Tolland County, CT m. 5/8/1779 in Coventry, Tolland County, CT
2 CONT Ann Brown Swetland 3/2/1778 in Coventry, Tolland County, CT m. 1/1800 in Longmeadow, MA
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 18x with Zipora*, Ann**
2 CONT *Ira Swetland 11/23/1780 - E. Longmeadow, MA 
2 CONT *Israel Swetland 3/23/1783  Lebanon, CT
2 CONT *Alminah "Alma" Swetland 3/5/1785 +
2 CONT *Sally Swetland 7/23/1787  CT +
2 CONT *Clarissa Swetland 1/5/1790 + 
2 CONT *Silas Swetland 6/1/1792  Coventry, Tolland County, CT 
2 CONT *Mary Polly Swetland 9/2/1795 
2 CONT *Sprague Swetland b: 5/8/1796 +
2 CONT *Mary P. Swetland b: 5/7/1798
2 CONT **Eleazer Swetland b: 22 FEB 1801 in East Longmeadow, MA
2 CONT **Joseph Swetland b: 25 NOV 1802 in East Longmeadow, MA +
2 CONT **Eli Swetland b: 7 JAN 1805 in East Longmeadow, MA + 
2 CONT **Anna Swetland b: 14 JAN 1807 in East Longmeadow, MA 
2 CONT **Irena Swetland b: 7 MAR 1809 in East Longmeadow, MA 
2 CONT **Acenith Swetland b: 30 APR 1811 in East Longmeadow, MA + 
2 CONT **George W. Swetland b: 13 AUG 1813 in Longmeadow, MA +
