2 CONT
2 CONT When Nathan Rood was born about 1815, in Connecticut, United States, his father, Rufus Rood, was 49 and his mother, Rebecca Hiscock, was 42. He married Hannah Spaulding on 26 November 1834, in Stafford, Tolland, Connecticut, Unite
2 CONC d States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. He lived in Wardsboro, Windham, Vermont, United States in 1850 and Townshend, Windham, Vermont, United States in 1860. He died on 25 March 1889, in Stafford, Tollan
2 CONC d, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 75.
2 CONT
