1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Age 53 yrs, 10 mos, 5 days. Eldest son of Amos and Lucy (Dart) Thurston. Married Lucy Wakely (b. Oct. 12, 1799, d. June 26, 1868). He was a farmer in Preston Township, Wayne County, PA. Note: This is a variation in
