1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sanford Swetland=
2 CONT * BIRTH 12 Oct 1823 Longmeadow, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 11 May 1884 (aged 60), Portland, Chautauqua County, New York, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Portland Evergreen Cemetery, Portland, Chautauqua County, New York, USA  Show Map GPS-Latitude: 42.3648261, Longitude: -79.4811672
2 CONT * PLOT lot 300 MEMORIAL ID 79965281 Photos by Ron Kinney
2 CONT
2 CONT Sanford Swetland was the son of Eleazer Swetland 1801–1867 & Philinda Crane Swetland 1802–1861 who married Rhoda Moore, born: 10 APR 1821 in Springfield, New York on 24 JAN 1838 in Cherry Valley, New York They had the following ch
2 CONC ildren: Ormal Reed Swetland b: 19 SEP 1852 in Middlefield Center, Otsego County, New York Has Children Benjamin Samuel Swetland b: 15 MAR 1854 in Middlefield Center, New York Has Children William S. Swetland b: 14 SEP 1855 in Midd
2 CONC lefield, New York Has No Children Philinda Swetland b: 15 DEC 1857 in New York Has No Children Orson Amos Swetland b: 11 FEB 1861 in Portland, Chautauqua County, New York
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1880 Census lists Sanford and family as living in Portland, Chautauqua County, New York. Sanford's occupation is shown as "Stone Mason". Sanford's son Ormal is living nearby. Sons William and Orson are still living in Sanford'
2 CONC s household.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gravesite Details'''
2 CONT spouse of Rhoda, son of Eleazer & Philinda Crane Swetland
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Eleazer Swetland 1801–1867
2 CONT Philinda Crane Swetland 1802–1861
2 CONT
