2 CONT William S. Swetland b: 14 SEP 1855 in Middlefield, New York Has No Children 
2 CONT Philinda Swetland b: 15 DEC 1857 in New York Has No Children 
2 CONT Orson Amos Swetland b: 11 FEB 1861 in Portland, Chautauqua County, New York
