1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Westfield Republican Newspaper: p.4, September 13, 1905.  "Bennet Swetland died August 29, 1905 at his home two miles north of Mayville after a long illness.  He leaves a wife [Harriet?], one daughter, Hattie, two 
2 CONC sons, Horace and Adelbert.  He was a member of the M.P. Church, and was loved and respected by all who knew him.  He was a true friend and a good neighbor."
