1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Military Record : (Sweatland, Swetland), George, Unit organized in Portland, CC-148.  Enlistment Date: 22 August 1862 Distinguished Service: DISTINGUISHED SERVICE Side Served: Union     State Served: New York     U
2 CONC nit Numbers: 154 Service Record: Enlisted as a Corporal on 22 August 1862 at the age of 27.  Enlisted in Company E, 154th Infantry Regiment New York on 24 September 1862. Wounded on 01 July 1863 at Gettysburg, Pennsylvania Promote
