1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Charles' birth, biography, and death information are available at https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/79457861/charles-ward-leete
2 CONT ** "Charles was age 14 when he moved, with his parents, to Potsdam, NY. He was a businessman of varied interests, especially Adirondack timber lands. 
2 CONT ** "He was partner, until 1867, in a foundry firm called Watkins & Leete, and later, when his brother Wilbur joined the firm, Watkins, Leete and Company. That tri-ownership continued for five years, but then, in January 1872, Char
2 CONC les became the sole owner.  
2 CONT ** " In June 1897 his son Charles succeeded him, though Charles Senior continued on as business manager. He and his family lived in Potsdam, New York."  
