1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT From History of Grant County, Wisconsin, 1881, p. 973.
2 CONT
2 CONT Town of Patch Grove
2 CONT
2 CONT A. W. CURTIS, Sec. 27; P. O. Patch Grove; owns 133-1/3 acres land, valued at $40 per acre; born in Schenectady Co., N. Y., in 1840; came to Wisconsin in 1866, and settled on this farm with his parents. Married Paulina Norton, a na
