1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She m1. Franklin David Rulon on 25 Sep 1895; they later divorced.
2 CONT She m2. Charles A. Hesner on 28 Oct 1908.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her obituary appeared in the 10 Nov 1936 issue of the Dubuque Telegraph Herald
2 CONT She was one of seven children born to Mr. and Mrs. Alonzo F. Smith. 
2 CONT She was educated in Edgewood and filled important clerical positions in the commercial life of the community.
2 CONT Survivors:
2 CONT her husband Charles A. Hesner, whom she married 28 Oct 1908
2 CONT one brother Charles Smith, of Edgewood
2 CONT one step-daughgter, Mrs. Floyd H. Hatch of Edgewood.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/5900393/neva-a-hesner Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 27 2022, 19:23:1
