1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Served as a private in Co. H, 13th West Virginia Infantry
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John & Aurilla (Grover) Searles.
2 CONT 1st married Rebecca Conkle Nov 19, 1865 in Gallia Co. Ohio.
2 CONT After Rebecca's death, he married Mary Conkle in 1910.
2 CONT
2 CONT Military service info: Enlisted 1 Dec 1863 and mustered in 11 Dec 1862 at Pt Pleasant, WV. 92 cents withheld for a haversack and canteen Nov/Dec 1863; present until mustered out 22 June 1865 at Wheeling, WV.
2 CONT Listed in 1890 Veterans Census living in Cheshire, Ohio suffering from deafness and disease of the spine.
