1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Frank Herbert Whitcomb'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/99031518/frank-herbert-whitcomb
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Elbridge Gerry Whitcomb and Salome Newcomb
2 CONT
2 CONT At the 1880 census of Keene, New Hampshire, he lived with his mother, brother Edward, the large family of his married brother Jonas and a servant. He is called a merchant tailor.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Grace Nims on 1 Sep 1880 in Keene, Cheshire, New Hampshire. Their marriage record calls him a merchant. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had children:
2 CONT
2 CONT . Edson Gerry Whitcomb, Sr. (1881 - 1953) + sp: Lillian Maxwell Cameron
2 CONT . Ralph Nims Whitcomb (1883 - 1972) + sp: Wilhelmina Roberts
2 CONT . Margaret Whitcomb (1885 - 1978) + sp: Harold Arthurs Peart (divorced) + sp: Ralph Edward Case
2 CONT . James Lanmon Whitcomb (1889 - 1984) + sp: Josephine Hale
2 CONT . Everett Newcomb Whitcomb (1893 - 1961) + sp: Anne Theresa Upham
2 CONT
2 CONT He worked for most of his life, from before 1900 until after 1940, as the City Clerk of Keene, New Hampshire.
