2 CONT Permilia Bundy Dayton" published Sept 1961 pg 51
2 CONT Julius was a talented pianist. He was associated with the Bassett Brothers Yellowstone Park Stage line. He was employed with the Utah Northern Railroad from 1878-1879. The family moved to Blackfoot, Idaho in 1884. He was Commissio
2 CONC ner of Immigration from 1897-1899; Secretary of the Territorial Legislature in 1880. He became Secretary of State of Idaho in 1901-1902. He was a kind. gentle and intelligent gentleman and a most efficient government adminstrator.
2 CONC  He was a devoted husband and father.
