1 NOTE {geni:about_me} CHARLES CITY, IOWA - Funeral services are set for Wednesday at 2 p.m. at the Floyd Methodist Church for E. E. Tubbs, 81, a long time resident of the Floyd and Osage area. He died Monday at the Mitchell County Memor
2 CONC ial Hospital, Osage.
2 CONT
2 CONT He owned and operated a well drilling outfit in this area for many years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial will be in the Osage City Cemetery with the Hauser Funeral Home, Charles City, in charge of arrangements.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by his wife; a brother, Earl Tubbs, Osage; and a sister, Mrs. Ruth Coonradt, Waverly.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Mason City Globe-Gazette, Tuesday, June 9, 1964]
2 CONT
