1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/L521-D9C/richard-lee-hicks-1939-2020
2 CONT When Richard Lee Hicks was born on 28 April 1939, in Battle Creek, Calhoun, Michigan, United States, his father, Richard Leroy Hicks, was 34 and his mother, Rhoda Elizabeth Frazer, was 29. He lived in Emmett Township, Calhoun, Mic
2 CONC higan, United States for about 15 years. He died on 23 January 2020, in Battle Creek, Calhoun, Michigan, United States, at the age of 80, and was buried in Reese Cemetery, Springfield, Calhoun, Michigan, United States.
2 CONT
