2 CONC t-size: small;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;He was married April 9, 1982, to Olivia L. Molly Lacey. Sur CONC viving are his wife and special friend of 21 years, sons, David A. (Angie) Snyder, Jason M. Hicks, an
