2 CONC  Erma E. White of Battle Creek, brother Richard L. Hicks of Albion, his special aunt, Lucille Hicks and several nieces and nephews. He was preceded in death by both his parents in 1973; and by t CONC hree sisters, Doris, Edna and 
2 CONC Helen&lt;/p&gt;</line><line>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica; font-size: small;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
