1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Edward Root “Ned” Swetland=
2 CONT * BIRTH 7 Jul 1884 Perry, Lake County, Ohio, USA
2 CONT * RESIDENCE 1900 - Portland Township, Election District 2, Chautauqua, New York, United States
2 CONT * DEATH 19 Oct 1975 (aged 91) Miami-Dade County, Florida, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Miami Memorial Park Cemetery, Miami, Miami-Dade County, Florida, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID  269247877  
2 CONT
2 CONT Services for Edward (Ned) Swetland. 91, a retired wholesale florist and resident of Miami since 1925. will be at 1:30 p.m. Wednesday in the Van Orsdel Coral Gables Chapel.  Mr. Swetland, a native of Perry, OH, died Sunday in the J
2 CONC ackson Manor Nursing Home.  He was a member of the First Baptist Church of South Miami.  Mr. Swetland is survived by two Daughters, Mrs. Ruth Mappin and Jean, a son, James E; three grandchildren and five great-grandchildren.  Repo
2 CONC se is from 7 to 9 p.m. today.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Mary Elizabeth Wood Swetland 1880–1964 (m. 1907)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT James Edward Swetland 1908–1996
2 CONT Ruth Deeley Swetland Mappin 1912–1995
2 CONT Martha Jean Swetland 1917–1997
2 CONT
